 462  Positive Variables
 463  vteste(ipipe)
 464  q_edge(iedge)     volumetric flow rate
 465  k_edge(iedge)     massic flow rate
 466  f_pu(ipump,s)     pump head
 467  f_pi(ipipe,n)     pipe head loss per subsection
 468  f_he(ihe)         heat exchanger head loss
 469  q_circ(icirc)     volumetric flow rate per circuit
 470  lvalve(icirc)     valve head loss
 471  cpipe             annualized capital cost of the pipe sections
 472  cpump             annualized capital cost for the pumping system
 473  cpen              annualized overall penalization due higher outlet temper
      ature of hot fluid
 474  cope              overall operating cost of a pump
 475  cr(ihe)           heat capacity ratio
 476  U(ihe)            overall heat transfer coefficient
 477  h_w(ihe)          convection heat transfer coefficient of water
 478  h_hot(ihe)        convection heat transfer coefficient of hot fluid
 479  NTU(ihe)          number of transfer units
 480  epsilon(ihe)      effectiveness of a counter-current flow heat exchanger
 481  k_he_hot(ihe)     mass flow rate of hot fluid in heat exchanger
 482  T_w_feed          water temperature at cooling tower inlet
 483  T_w_base          water temperature at cooling tower outlet
 484  T_w_in(ihe)       water temperature at heat exchanger inlet
 485  T_w_out(ihe)      water temperature at heat exchanger outlet
 486  T_hot_out(ihe)    hot fluid temperature at heat exchanger outlet
 487  che(ihe)          financial loss
 488  IM                integral of Merkel
